# Shader Cross-Compilation & Graphics API Translation

This skill governs the translation, validation, optimization, and cross-compilation of real-time game shaders across APIs (DirectX 9/11/12, Vulkan, OpenGL/ES, Metal, and WebGPU).

---

## 1. Toolchain & Compilation Matrix

| Source Format | Target Format | Primary Tool | Key Flags |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **GLSL (Core/ES)** | **SPIR-V** | `glslangValidator` | `-V -S vert/frag/comp -o output.spv` |
| **HLSL (SM 5.x/6.x)**| **SPIR-V** | `glslangValidator` / `dxc` | `-D -V -e main -T vs_6_0 / ps_6_0` |
| **SPIR-V** | **Optimized SPIR-V** | `spirv-opt` | `-O -Oconfig=... --strip-debug` |
| **SPIR-V** | **Validated SPIR-V** | `spirv-val` | `spirv-val shader.spv` |
| **SPIR-V** | **Disassembly / IR**| `spirv-dis` | `spirv-dis shader.spv -o shader.spvasm` |
| **SPIR-V** | **GLSL / MSL / HLSL**| `spirv-cross` | `--version 450 --msl --hlsl` |

